      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think if there was previously a concurrent map access then there is now a data race on the `closed` field.  There is no synchronization between the writer and the readers, which could be in different goroutines.\n\nFor example, a call to `StartAction` could have finished checking `cp.closed` and moved on to `cp.criticalPath.StartAction` when another goroutines enters `Flush`, updates `cp.closed` too late, and then calls `cp.criticalPath.criticalPath()` concurrently.",
      "revId": "5d63ad61ba501ae4b3659336a70dfb2a10769f10",
